'''The Lotus Eater''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Lotus Eater's Cave}} of the {{zone|Lotus Atoll}}. They spawn in for {{Green|30}} minutes after the player throws {{Item|Frogcoin|amount=4}}s into the water.

== Purpose ==
'''The Lotus Eater''' sells the {{Item|Lily Pad Minion XII Upgrade Stone}} for a {{Item|Diamond Lotus}}.

